		"packages/axc-verification/**"
	],
	"_comment_eval": "Iteration 2. allowed_write_globs is the Task A boundary from this repo's task-set-a-prompt.md. Anything outside it \u2014 including pnpm-lock.yaml at the root, which the baseline wrote \u2014 is denied."
